    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Interview a UX Researcher\r\n\r\nMeet Darius — an AI simulation of a UX researcher whose job is to find out whether AI products actually work for the people who are supposed to use them. Before you use these chatbots to get feedback on your guide, interview Darius to learn what his work really involves.\r\n\r\n1. Ask Darius at least three of these questions:\r\n\r\n   - What does a typical day look like for you?\r\n\r\n   - What made you want to do this kind of work?\r\n\r\n   - What's something about your job that most people wouldn't expect?\r\n\r\n   - What skills matter most in your work?\r\n\r\n2. Ask at least one question of your own.\r\n\r\n**Note:** Darius is an AI simulation, not a real person. Part of your job as a tester: notice where the simulation feels accurate and where it falls short.",
